{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Horde Won't Stop is a Third Person Shooter in a zombie post apocalyptical world. The aim is to survive as long as possible. Each level becomes progressively more difficult with more zombies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/a00f4b4349a45659ed2406833197d6dd.avif?t=1773169458\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have time to buy weapons after each level has been completed. You have a wide range of firearms, grenades, melee weapons and upgrades to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/d1ebdd8882a6d6cb9c67a225b08c4ce6.avif?t=1773169458\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over every action which includes moving, aiming, shooting, throwing grenades and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different types of zombies to keep things interesting and to make it more challenging for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643830?t=1773169458","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643830?t=1773169458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/2e92fed9714a3478cd46f081898492b1c42f0f75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773169458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/2e92fed9714a3478cd46f081898492b1c42f0f75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773169458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Horde Won't Stop is a Third Person Shooter in a zombie post apocalyptical world. The aim is to survive as long as possible. Each level becomes progressively more difficult with more zombies to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/a00f4b4349a45659ed2406833197d6dd.avif?t=1773169458\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have time to buy weapons after each level has been completed. You have a wide range of firearms, grenades, melee weapons and upgrades to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/extras/d1ebdd8882a6d6cb9c67a225b08c4ce6.avif?t=1773169458\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over every action which includes moving, aiming, shooting, throwing grenades and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different types of zombies to keep things interesting and to make it more challenging for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Reliable Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643830/f3eac13fa25c07841609e3004af553519756d9a0/header.jpg?t=1773169458","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643830/1833616464/3a79b951e11419b5f2a012e915905fbcec0cd2ad/1755718766/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755719600","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643830/1833616464/3a79b951e11419b5f2a012e915905fbcec0cd2ad/1755718766/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755719600","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.